# Copy this file to server/.env and fill in real values.
# server/.env is gitignored — never commit real credentials.

# Forgot Password sends a 6-digit confirmation code over real email via
# Gmail SMTP. You need an App Password (NOT your regular Gmail password):
#   1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on your Google account, if not already on:
#      https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Generate an App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#      (choose "Mail" as the app) — Google gives you a 16-character code.
#   3. Put your Gmail address and that 16-character code below.
GMAIL_USER=youraddress@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your16characterapppassword
